[statement]
Reduced from a layered request over Alpine v3.24 (`main` and `community`,
2026-11-11): `ocaml-mmap`'s closure from v3.23 installed and asked at a
later version. The later `ocaml-mmap` needs a name only `ocaml` 4.14.4
provides, and `ocaml` needs `ocaml-runtime` at 4.14.4 exactly; the
installed `ocaml-runtime` is 4.14.2, in no world. apk upgrades it:
`ocaml-runtime=4.14.4-r0` is required through `ocaml`, the single
candidate of the name `ocaml-mmap` needs, before `ocaml` is installed
(`installed/a-sole-candidate-s-constraint-upgrades-an-installed-package`).

[repository]
P:merlin
V:4.14-r3
D:ocaml4-impl:Unix:6ad958f5fc3606e1ce1a19bb744939cb

P:merlin-emacs
V:4.14-r3
i:merlin=4.14-r3 emacs

P:ocaml
V:4.14.4-r0
D:ocaml-runtime=4.14.4-r0
p:ocaml4-impl:Unix:6ad958f5fc3606e1ce1a19bb744939cb=4.14.4-r0

P:ocaml-doc
V:4.14.4-r0
i:docs ocaml=4.14.4-r0

P:ocaml-mmap
V:1.2.0-r6
D:ocaml4-impl:Unix:6ad958f5fc3606e1ce1a19bb744939cb

P:ocaml-runtime
V:4.14.4-r0

P:ocp-index-doc
V:1.4.0-r3
i:docs ocp-index=1.4.0-r3

P:ocp-index-emacs
V:1.4.0-r3
i:ocp-index=1.4.0-r3 emacs

[installed]
P:ocaml-runtime
V:4.14.2-r2

[request]
ocaml-mmap>1.2.0-r3

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
upgrade ocaml-runtime 4.14.2-r2 4.14.4-r0
install ocaml 4.14.4-r0
install ocaml-mmap 1.2.0-r6
